    DiNola, A., & Haak, J. R. (1984).
    Molecular dynamics with coupling to an external bath.
    The Journal of Chemical Physics, 81(8), 3684–3690.
    https://doi.org/10.1063/1.448118


DFTB+ Software
    B. Hourahine, B. Aradi, V. Blum, F. Bonafé, A. Buccheri,
    C. Camacho, C. Cevallos, M. Y. Deshaye, T. Dumitrică,
